flowchart TD
    Host[Trusted host: explicit placement credentials] --> Config{Configuration valid?}
    Config -->|No| Reject[Reject binding]
    Config -->|Yes| Mode{Runtime configuration}
    Mode -->|Composite| Pools[Shared lazy pools: scheduler, execution, user]
    Pools --> Startup[HostedRuntime validates every binding before returning]
    Startup --> Services[Separate caller, coordinator and worker handles]
    Mode -->|Single role| Scoped[One lazy pool per supplied placement]
    Scoped --> ScopedStartup["Validate control for run client and coordinator<br/>Check worker configuration"]
    ScopedStartup --> Services
    Services --> Routing[Internal routers retain one fixed authority]
    Routing --> Bound{Alias supplied and purpose compatible?}
    Bound -->|No| Reject
    Bound -->|Yes| Reuse[Reuse exact bound pool; no credential discovery]
    Reuse --> Connect[Open physical connection when needed]
    Connect --> Guard{Fixed login, scoped table grants, row protections and functions valid?}
    Guard -->|No| Close[Discard connection]
    Guard -->|Yes| Ready[Connection available to its authority]
    Pools --> Client[UserClient shares user pools]
    Client --> Status[Typed status operation]
    Status --> User[User-role transaction and row policies]
    Host --> Revalidate[Explicit deployment revalidation]
    Revalidate --> Guard
    Startup --> Guard
    ScopedStartup -->|Control connection| Guard
    Services --> Cancel[Host cancellation, service drain and join]
    Cancel -->|Composite runtime| Shutdown[Close shared pools]
    Cancel -->|Separate roles| Release[Drop role handles]
